  intro V _ _ _ ev X _ m t δ 𝔪 C lab T hT V' _ _ _ io f hf hinj hfin ev₂ 𝔪₂ ψ hD bc hExt hyK hcart hw hφ hmon hU he₈ hgen zt hzt
